                                                "sense_id": "13e9b0dc-1d43-31d5-b57b-41955884a87a",
                                                "text": "After breakfast it takes a stout heart and strong nerve to tackle the burden of dishwashing, separator, milk things, disorderly house, interspersed with quarrels, naggings, and interruptions of the children[…]"
